{"seq":2,"slug":"resilience-patterns","title":"韧性系统设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/resilience-patterns","wordCount":907,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"韧性系统设计模式\">韧性系统设计模式</h1><p>韧性（Resilience）不是单一特性，而是由多个互补机制共同构成的系统能力。混沌工程的目的之一，是验证这些设计模式在真实压力下是否按预期生效。本篇系统梳理构成韧性的六类核心模式及其组合策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>熔断器（Circuit Breaker）</td>\n<td>检测下游持续失败后断开连接，防止雪崩传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级（Degradation）</td>\n<td>在部分功能不可用时提供简化服务，而非完全失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时（Timeout）</td>\n<td>设置调用上限时间，防止慢请求耗尽线程资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试（Retry）</td>\n<td>对瞬时失败自动重试，配合指数退避防止放大压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舱壁（Bulkhead）</td>\n<td>隔离不同请求的资源池，防止一类请求拖垮全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗余（Redundancy）</td>\n<td>多副本部署，单点故障不影响服务整体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"熔断器模式\">熔断器模式</h2><p>熔断器是最重要的防雪崩机制，防止一个服务的故障级联传播：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; CLOSED: 初始状态&#10;    CLOSED --&gt; OPEN: 失败率超过阈值\\n(如 50% 失败 / 10 秒窗口)&#10;    OPEN --&gt; HALF_OPEN: 等待恢复窗口\\n(如 30 秒后)&#10;    HALF_OPEN --&gt; CLOSED: 探测请求成功&#10;    HALF_OPEN --&gt; OPEN: 探测请求失败&#10;&#10;    CLOSED: CLOSED\\n正常转发请求&#10;    OPEN: OPEN\\n立即返回降级响应&#10;    HALF_OPEN: HALF_OPEN\\n放通少量探测请求\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; CLOSED: 初始状态\n    CLOSED --&gt; OPEN: 失败率超过阈值\\n(如 50% 失败 / 10 秒窗口)\n    OPEN --&gt; HALF_OPEN: 等待恢复窗口\\n(如 30 秒后)\n    HALF_OPEN --&gt; CLOSED: 探测请求成功\n    HALF_OPEN --&gt; OPEN: 探测请求失败\n\n    CLOSED: CLOSED\\n正常转发请求\n    OPEN: OPEN\\n立即返回降级响应\n    HALF_OPEN: HALF_OPEN\\n放通少量探测请求</pre><p><strong>Go 实现示例（使用 gobreaker 库）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import &quot;github.com/sony/gobreaker&quot;&#10;&#10;cb := gobreaker.NewCircuitBreaker(gobreaker.Settings{&#10;    Name:        &quot;payment-service&quot;,&#10;    MaxRequests: 3,          // HALF_OPEN 状态下允许的探测请求数&#10;    Interval:    10 * time.Second, // CLOSED 状态下的统计窗口&#10;    Timeout:     30 * time.Second, // OPEN 状态持续时间&#10;    ReadyToTrip: func(counts gobreaker.Counts) bool {&#10;        failureRatio := float64(counts.TotalFailures) / float64(counts.Requests)&#10;        return counts.Requests &gt;= 3 &amp;&amp; failureRatio &gt;= 0.5&#10;    },&#10;    OnStateChange: func(name string, from, to gobreaker.State) {&#10;        log.Printf(&quot;熔断器 %s 状态变更: %s → %s&quot;, name, from, to)&#10;    },&#10;})&#10;&#10;result, err := cb.Execute(func() (interface{}, error) {&#10;    return callPaymentService(req)&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/sony/gobreaker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gobreaker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewCircuitBreaker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gobreaker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Name:        </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MaxRequests: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HALF_OPEN 状态下允许的探测请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Interval:    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CLOSED 状态下的统计窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Timeout:     </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// OPEN 状态持续时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ReadyToTrip: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">counts</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gobreaker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Counts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        failureRatio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(counts.TotalFailures) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(counts.Requests)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counts.Requests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failureRatio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OnStateChange: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">to</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gobreaker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"熔断器 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 状态变更: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> → </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name, from, to)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callPaymentService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"降级策略\">降级策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>降级类型</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态降级</td>\n<td>返回缓存结果或默认值</td>\n<td>推荐列表、非关键配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能降级</td>\n<td>关闭非核心功能</td>\n<td>个性化功能降级为通用功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读写分离降级</td>\n<td>只读模式</td>\n<td>数据库主库故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列降级</td>\n<td>同步转异步</td>\n<td>下游处理能力不足时入队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func GetRecommendations(userID string) []Product {&#10;    products, err := recommendationSvc.Fetch(userID)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        // 降级：返回热销榜单作为兜底&#10;        return cache.GetHotProducts()&#10;    }&#10;    return products&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GetRecommendations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    products, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recommendationSvc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 降级：返回热销榜单作为兜底</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetHotProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"超时与重试\">超时与重试</h2><p>超时防止慢调用耗尽资源，重试处理瞬时失败——两者必须配合使用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    REQ[请求] --&gt; RETRY{重试次数\\n&lt; 最大值?}&#10;    RETRY --&gt;|是| CALL[带超时调用]&#10;    CALL --&gt;|超时| WAIT[指数退避等待]&#10;    WAIT --&gt; RETRY&#10;    CALL --&gt;|成功| RESP[返回响应]&#10;    CALL --&gt;|持久失败| ERR[返回错误/降级]&#10;    RETRY --&gt;|超出最大值| ERR\">flowchart LR\n    REQ[请求] --&gt; RETRY{重试次数\\n&lt; 最大值?}\n    RETRY --&gt;|是| CALL[带超时调用]\n    CALL --&gt;|超时| WAIT[指数退避等待]\n    WAIT --&gt; RETRY\n    CALL --&gt;|成功| RESP[返回响应]\n    CALL --&gt;|持久失败| ERR[返回错误/降级]\n    RETRY --&gt;|超出最大值| ERR</pre><p><strong>超时层次设计</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>超时值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据库查询</td>\n<td>100ms</td>\n<td>单次 SQL 查询上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部 RPC</td>\n<td>500ms</td>\n<td>服务间调用上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部 API</td>\n<td>2s</td>\n<td>第三方服务调用上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户请求</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>面向用户的响应上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>指数退避重试</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func retryWithBackoff(ctx context.Context, fn func() error, maxRetries int) error {&#10;    backoff := 100 * time.Millisecond&#10;    for i := 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++ {&#10;        if err := fn(); err == nil {&#10;            return nil&#10;        }&#10;        select {&#10;        case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;            return ctx.Err()&#10;        case &lt;-time.After(backoff):&#10;            backoff *= 2 // 指数增长&#10;            if backoff &gt; 30*time.Second {&#10;                backoff = 30 * time.Second&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return fmt.Errorf(&quot;超过最大重试次数 %d&quot;, maxRetries)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retryWithBackoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxRetries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Millisecond</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRetries; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Err</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">After</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(backoff):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 指数增长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Errorf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"超过最大重试次数 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxRetries)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"舱壁模式\">舱壁模式</h2><p>舱壁（Bulkhead）将系统资源隔离为独立池，防止高并发请求池耗尽影响低并发但关键的请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 使用独立的连接池隔离不同客户&#10;type BulkheadPool struct {&#10;    vipPool     chan struct{} // VIP 用户专用 goroutine 池（50 个）&#10;    normalPool  chan struct{} // 普通用户 goroutine 池（20 个）&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (b *BulkheadPool) Execute(isVIP bool, fn func() error) error {&#10;    pool := b.normalPool&#10;    if isVIP {&#10;        pool = b.vipPool&#10;    }&#10;    select {&#10;    case pool &lt;- struct{}{}:&#10;        defer func() { &lt;-pool }()&#10;        return fn()&#10;    default:&#10;        return ErrPoolExhausted&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用独立的连接池隔离不同客户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BulkheadPool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vipPool     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// VIP 用户专用 goroutine 池（50 个）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normalPool  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 普通用户 goroutine 池（20 个）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BulkheadPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">isVIP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.normalPool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isVIP {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.vipPool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}{}:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pool }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrPoolExhausted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"韧性模式组合策略\">韧性模式组合策略</h2><p>单一模式无法保证完整韧性，实践中的组合策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"调用层次: Client → [重试+超时] → [熔断器] → [舱壁] → 服务端 → [降级]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>调用层次: Client → [重试+超时] → [熔断器] → [舱壁] → 服务端 → [降级]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐组合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第三方 API 调用</td>\n<td>超时 + 重试（有限次）+ 熔断器 + 降级（缓存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库访问</td>\n<td>超时 + 连接池舱壁 + 只读降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微服务调用</td>\n<td>超时 + 熔断器 + 降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息消费</td>\n<td>重试 + DLQ + 背压控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式与注意事项\">常见反模式与注意事项</h2><ul>\n<li>无熔断的无限重试：下游过载时重试会成倍放大流量，必须与熔断器、退避配合</li>\n<li>全链路共享连接池：一个慢依赖会占满共享池，关键与非关键请求应分池隔离（舱壁）</li>\n<li>超时值层层相等：下游超时必须小于上游剩余预算，否则上游先超时、无法感知下游真实结果</li>\n<li>重试缺乏幂等保证：非幂等写操作重试会造成重复扣款、重复下单等副作用</li>\n<li>降级逻辑长期不执行：兜底分支会腐化，需要混沌实验定期触发来验证</li>\n<li>熔断阈值长期不变：业务流量形态变化后，静态阈值会误熔断或该熔不断</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>韧性设计是分层防御：重试处理瞬时故障，超时防止资源耗尽，熔断器阻断故障传播，舱壁隔离故障影响，降级保证核心服务可用，冗余消除单点故障。混沌实验的价值在于验证这套防御体系在真实压力下是否按设计生效。度量框架见<a href=\"chaos-metrics\">混沌实验度量框架</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"韧性系统设计模式","id":"韧性系统设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断器模式","id":"熔断器模式"},{"level":2,"text":"降级策略","id":"降级策略"},{"level":2,"text":"超时与重试","id":"超时与重试"},{"level":2,"text":"舱壁模式","id":"舱壁模式"},{"level":2,"text":"韧性模式组合策略","id":"韧性模式组合策略"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式与注意事项","id":"常见反模式与注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混沌工程核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/chaos-principles"},"next":{"title":"混沌实验度量框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/chaos-metrics"}}